03:36:03.800 --> 03:36:04.040
We'll be right back.

03:38:00.350 --> 03:38:00.610
You

03:40:30.060 --> 03:40:39.640
That's a double rump.

03:40:53.900 --> 03:40:54.960
There's a quiet cove.

03:40:55.220 --> 03:40:55.900
Much company, mate?

03:40:56.290 --> 03:40:56.930
Not much, sir.

03:40:58.570 --> 03:40:59.270
Who'd be the owner?

03:41:00.030 --> 03:41:02.060
