03:41:02.740 --> 03:41:03.300
In the town.

03:41:04.530 --> 03:41:04.590
Hmm.

03:41:07.720 --> 03:41:08.300
What's your name?

03:41:09.170 --> 03:41:09.870
Jim Hawkins.

03:41:11.480 --> 03:41:13.610
Well, Jim, you seems a likely lad.

03:41:14.390 --> 03:41:16.830
Ever notice a sea fairy man alongside this here grog shop?

03:41:17.680 --> 03:41:19.140
Not many come out so far, sir.

03:41:19.600 --> 03:41:21.400
None by the name of Captain William Bones.

03:41:24.260 --> 03:41:24.900
Bones, sir?

03:41:32.520 --> 03:41:33.060
No matter.

03:41:34.350 --> 03:41:34.970
Fill her up.

03:42:07.860 --> 03:42:14.950
Was it a one-leg man?

03:42:15.370 --> 03:42:19.320
No, sir, but he had a terrible scar.

03:42:21.960 --> 03:42:27.430
Dog, when you see his black dog, you lay to it.

03:42:28.370 --> 03:42:29.970
Man with a one leg ain't far...

03:42:31.680 --> 03:42:34.580
Rum, Jim. Fetch me rum.

03:42:35.310 --> 03:42:38.560
Captain, Dr. Lizzie.

03:42:39.090 --> 03:42:41.840
Oh, hang on, Doctor. Give me rum.

03:43:07.130 --> 03:43:09.360
The doctor said it'd kill you.

03:43:11.900 --> 03:43:13.900
Don't stop. I'll rent it down for the doctor.

03:43:14.660 --> 03:43:15.500
And the squire, too.

03:43:22.710 --> 03:43:27.000
Give me strength back, Jim. Pull out of here.

03:43:59.080 --> 03:43:59.660
and clip.

03:44:00.000 --> 03:44:04.260
and I'll break your arm straight to him now.

03:44:05.690 --> 03:44:05.970
March!

03:44:16.540 --> 03:44:19.280
Here's a friend for you, Bill.

03:44:22.300 --> 03:44:24.720
You, as ever was, Bill,

03:44:25.070 --> 03:44:29.780
back the gift of all your old shipmates.

03:44:30.760 --> 03:44:34.050
Boy, take him to the rest and bring his hat close to mine.

03:44:40.730 --> 03:44:41.330
And now...

03:45:08.450 --> 03:45:12.860
I know what they're after, but they won't get it out of me.

03:45:13.200 --> 03:45:14.840
What's rightful mine is mine.

03:45:16.550 --> 03:45:17.610
Give me your hands here.

03:45:18.370 --> 03:45:20.400
Do that one-legged man, yes.

03:46:50.930 --> 03:46:58.120
Go and bring help. Don't peach.

03:47:00.000 --> 03:47:17.040
go shares them mutton heads that slipped me the black spot gets here before you come back

03:47:17.040 --> 03:47:21.290
find that on me skip now

